WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:07,650
What wind blew Master Chen up?

2
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:09,840
Let’s discuss future business

3
00:00:10,840 --> 00:00:12,900
Changed brand

4
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:13,900
The bark is rotten

5
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,900
Two people will come the next day

6
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:16,900
They all come to the palace with you

7
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,900
Come on the same day, return on the same day

8
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:19,900
Okay, two people

9
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:21,900
Are you willing to let two people out?

10
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,900
What you have here is the most powerful

11
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:23,900
People are idle in the camp

12
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,900
You go hungry

13
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:26,900
I happen to be going on a long trip

14
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:27,900
Need to carry more cargo

15
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,900
What a life for two people

16
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:31,900
Then listen to two people

17
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:32,900
Put the conditions first

18
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:33,900
Eat for three days

19
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:34,900
Damn it

20
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:35,900
Sticky and go on the same day

21
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,900
I'll settle the account on your head

22
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:38,900
There is one more

23
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:39,900
daily list

24
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:40,900
Deliver it to Zhao Ya

25
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:41,900
Who moves for whom?

26
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,900
Say hello list in advance

27
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:44,900
I'll report it

28
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:45,900
your account

29
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:46,900
and my account

30
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:47,900
Gotta be right

31
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:48,900
Not right

32
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:52,460
Just stop living

33
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,460
This line is empty

34
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:54,460
That's a substitute

35
00:00:56,460 --> 00:00:58,620
You won’t need to keep it even once a year

36
00:00:58,620 --> 00:01:00,620
Is it to save the road for yourself?
